      <title>Single Moms BBQ</title>
      <link>https://www.lancasterbaptist.org/connection-group-activity/single-moms-bbq</link>
      <description>On Sunday, June 9th, we are hosting a BBQ lunch for singles moms after the 10:45 service at the Pavilion. If you are a single mom, you and your children are invited to this Sunday lunch. If you know a single mom who we can be a blessing to in this way, invite them to the service on June 9th and they can enjoy the BBQ after the service.</description>
